d like to thank the hard-working  volunteers who contributed to this  campaign knocking on doors whether it  was raining or whether the Sun was  shining you made all the difference  and I'm really really grateful for all  your unwavering support I'm also proud  of the campaign we ran locally I'm proud  to of the campaign at the national level  labor ran a policy focused campaign  which offered a vision of hope and I  will continue to carry this hope forward  throughout the next parliament it has  been the greatest honor of my life to  represent you all in Parliament over the  last two years and I look forward to  continuing to serve as your MP thank you
 

